        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Within thirty (30) calendar days of the signing of this Agreement, the University and the Union shall convene a Joint Labor/Management Committee (JLM) to develop and produce within two (2) years of the ratification of this Agreement a detailed organizational chart of AFSCME positions within the University indicating for each bargaining unit position the optional career paths. The parties will explore career paths for internal promotions.",
