        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Written notice of intent to suspend for more than five (5) working days, demote, or dismiss shall be given to the employee, either by delivery of the notice to the employee in person or by placing the notice of intent in the United States mail, first class postage paid, in an envelope addressed to the employee at the employee's last known home address.",
